          "author": "Bruce Coville",
          "description": "Moongobble must complete one last Mighty Task before he is accepted into the Society of Magicians. But this one is a doozy: he must retrieve \"The Queen's Belly Button\"—an enchanted stone that has turned an entire elf village bad! Soon, Edward and Moongobble—along with Urk the Toad, Fireball the Dragon, and the Rusty Knight—are off on their greatest adventure yet. Can they regain the stone without turning evil themselves? This fun-filled tale of magic and adventure will have the entire family laughing out loud!",
